  dialogueLines:
  - Oh, hello, dear! I haven't seen your girlfriend leave for work today..
  - Everything alright at home?
  - Oh, how lovely! You know, my niece visits her mother every Sunday. Family is important.
  - Well, now I'm wondering what there is to hear...
  - Small? Oh, dear. Is she sick? Is this some sort of medical situation?
